{"4065560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sign of Silence: 99 Nights", "steam_appid": 4065560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the darkness, in a forest where every night, real horror lurks among the trees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.poster.avif?t=1786986268\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.webm?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.mp4?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few who survived the accident, and your task is simple... but terrifying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 99 nights: every evening, the darkness grows thicker, the enemies become more dangerous, and resources become scarcer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forest's lore: collect diaries to uncover the secrets of an ancient cult that once lived here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fear, not just monsters: noise attracts danger, light can be a blessing or a curse, footsteps in the dark are louder than screams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.poster.avif?t=1786986268\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.webm?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.mp4?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate or survive alone: team up with friends to stop the darkness together... or take on the challenge alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a camp and defend it from nighttime attacks: a campfire and torch can be your best friends—until they go out...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the darkness, in a forest where every night, real horror lurks among the trees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.poster.avif?t=1786986268\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.webm?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.mp4?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few who survived the accident, and your task is simple... but terrifying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 99 nights: every evening, the darkness grows thicker, the enemies become more dangerous, and resources become scarcer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forest's lore: collect diaries to uncover the secrets of an ancient cult that once lived here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fear, not just monsters: noise attracts danger, light can be a blessing or a curse, footsteps in the dark are louder than screams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.poster.avif?t=1786986268\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.webm?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.mp4?t=1786986268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate or survive alone: team up with friends to stop the darkness together... or take on the challenge alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a camp and defend it from nighttime attacks: a campfire and torch can be your best friends—until they go out...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The survivors, lost in the cursed forest, must endure 99 nights, battling merciless monsters and uncovering terrifying secrets. Build a camp, gather resources, and fight the encroaching darkness in this atmospheric survival horror game", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/a0fb8069b4c73a080c121bea336720a361260bd9/header.jpg?t=1786986268", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/490f02937c9a8dd993defe1798198866f7570288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786986268", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/490f02937c9a8dd993defe1798198866f7570288/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786986268", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD equivalent (A